  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "At the center of the righteous path Gu formation he angrily watches Qiao clan bring Fairy Miao Yin inside more often. He says Miao Yin once destroyed two important Ba clan resource points and injured four Ba clan Gu Immortals who chased her, and that Qiao clan Gu Immortals have no restraints. Ba De calls him Little Feng and tells him not to be anxious, noting Qiao clan’s long alliance marriages with Wu clan. Ba Quan Feng still calls Qiao clan a dog raised by Wu clan, complains that Wu clan’s immortal opportunity business excludes Ba clan and other forces who contributed Immortal Gu to the formation, and blushes when Ba De exposes his wish that everyone share the profits. He worries Wu clan’s two rank eight Gu Immortals will overpower Ba clan’s one when the dream realm is split.",
      "chapters": [
        1214
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_gu_formation",
        "fac_qiao_clan",
        "char_fairy_miao_yin",
        "fac_ba_clan",
        "sys_gu_immortal",
        "char_ba_de",
        "fac_wu_clan",
        "sys_immortal_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "When Wu Yi Hai enters the formation, Ba Quan Feng observes Ba De carefully and is disappointed when Ba De only says to observe for now. Narration states that while Wu clan was strong he had many opinions about it, and that after Wu Du Xiu’s death he has notions of suppressing the newcomer to vent frustration, especially with strong Ba clan stirring.",
      "chapters": [
        1223
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "wu-yi-hai-arrival",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_wu_yi_hai",
        "char_wu_du_xiu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He looks toward Wu clan discontentedly at Wu Yi Hai’s patient seclusion, laughs that Wu Yi Hai is merely an Eastern Sea lone cultivator, and proposes ruining the immortal opportunity business to force action. Ba De refuses, calls him too rash, and orders that if Wu Yi Hai does not come out, Ba Quan Feng will also stay in seclusion. He answers Yes lord with a bitter expression and leaves.",
      "chapters": [
        1231
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "ordered-into-seclusion",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "reg_eastern_sea"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "When the super Gu formation comes under attack from within Qiao clan’s area, Ba Quan Feng shouts that he warned the immortal opportunity business would cause problems and blames Qiao clan for toying with fire, since Ba clan took no part in the business.",
      "chapters": [
        1349
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "blaming-the-immortal-opportunity-business",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_super_gu_formation"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "At the crucial moment Chi Gui activates the super Gu formation’s second layer, Ba Quan Feng, who had been guarding him, attacks him with a vicious blow instead, destroying the newly added earth path Immortal Gu and causing the activation to fail. Ba De strikes Ba Quan Feng down in rage, leaving him on the verge of death.",
      "chapters": [
        1355
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "sneak-attack-during-the-second-layers-activation",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_chi_gui"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan returns inside the hole to find Ba Quan Feng and Chi Gui on the verge of death. An information path Gu shows that Ba Quan Feng was a spy from Shadow Sect. Fang Yuan tells Ba De to take Chi Gui and Ba Quan Feng away while he works on the formation’s second layer.",
      "chapters": [
        1356
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "shadow-sect-spy",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "fac_shadow_sect"
      ]
    }
  ],
